  "keyFeatures": [
    "Route to 250+ LLMs with a single OpenAI-compatible API",
    "Sub-1ms latency with a tiny 122kb footprint",
    "Automatic retries with exponential backoff",
    "Fallback routing across providers on failures",
    "Load balancing across multiple API keys or providers",
    "50+ built-in and partner guardrails for input/output validation",
    "MCP Gateway for managing Model Context Protocol servers",
    "Caching (simple and semantic) to reduce costs and latency",
    "Multi-modal support (vision, audio, image generation)",
    "Realtime WebSocket API support",
    "Plugin system for custom guardrails and transformers",
    "Deployable to Node.js, Docker, Cloudflare Workers, AWS, GCP, Azure"
  ],
